WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Check the draft decision
Check the action and reasoning and set a review date. Review the memo before saving it.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Check access and the destination project
Sign-in and active Pro are required. A first trial starts after consent to store the selected memo in your account; confirm device saving separately.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Confirm the save succeeded
Distinguish account memo storage from device project storage. Source CSV files and full reports do not automatically sync to the account.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Review new results in the same project
Open the project and upload the next period’s CSV. Compare the saved reasoning with new results before updating the review status.
